---
description: Testing
globs: *.spec.ts
---
* tests will use the `// Arrange` `// Act` `// Assert` comment convention.
* We should have a test for every production class or function. (A test framework is not yet wired up in this repo; once it is, mirror the convention used in theseus-back-end.)
* mocks in unit tests will have a suffix of Mock
* spies in unit tests will have a suffix of Spy
* tests will always live in `__specs__` folder next to the SUTs they test.
* tests will always be named after the production code's filename, but with the `.spec.ts` suffix.
* test suites name sut variable with the keyword `target`
* tests will use random generated data where appropriate from the test-utils files.
* No `any` types
